  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> <br > <math><msup><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br > <math><mi>F</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>  is decreasing, also  <math><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br >Now,   <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <br > <math><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mi>x</mi><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br > <math><mo>∴</mo><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br >Also,<br > <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> <br > <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br >Also,  <math><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>  is strictly decreasing<br >Now,   <math><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br > <math><mo>∴</mo><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi> </mi><msup><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi> </mi><mi> </mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi> </mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  is decreasing."
